naabu native UDP service detection
===================================

The UDP protocol plugins in this directory (pkg/fingerprint/udp/services/*)
were adapted from the Nerva service fingerprinting engine:

    https://github.com/praetorian-inc/nerva
    Copyright 2022 Praetorian Security, Inc.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is available at:

    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The code was ported to naabu's own plugin interface and trimmed to the UDP
detection path: security-misconfiguration findings, deep-probe behaviour and
the TCP/TLS sibling plugins from the original were not carried over.
